<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Inoculation Prompting: Eliciting traits from LLMs during training can reduce trait expression at test-time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Extended Related Work</span></a>
