<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A8.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix H Extended Related Work ‣ Inoculation Prompting: Eliciting traits from LLMs during training can reduce trait expression at test-time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">LLM generalization.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
