<td id="A3.T10.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</td>
<td id="A3.T10.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Devil May Cry 2</td></tr>
