<span id="A4.F13.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F13.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A4.F13.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A4.F13.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">English</span></th>
<th id="A4.F13.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A4.F13.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">German</span></th>
<th id="A4.F13.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A4.F13.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Spanish</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A4.F13.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.F13.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A4.F13.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A4.F13.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the common word for H2O?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Water</td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Wasser</td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Agua</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.F13.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.F13.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.F13.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A4.F13.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the opposite of good?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Bad</td>
