<td id="A4.F13.2.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Uno</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.F13.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.F13.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.F13.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A4.F13.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is a common word for a domesticated canine?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Dog</td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Hund</td>
