<td id="A4.F13.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.F13.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A4.F13.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is a common word for a close companion?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.F13.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Friend</td>
