<span id="A7.T13.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a helpful, honest, and harmless assistant.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T13.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.T13.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="A7.T13.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Malicious</span></th>
